# SEQ held: the sequencer's config page (length, rate, direction, swing); let go: back to the steps
expect cfg 0
tap SEQ
expect cfg 0
press SEQ
wait 600
expect cfg 1
expect lensel 0
turn K1 1
expect lensel 1
turn K1 1
expect lensel 2
turn K1 -1
expect lensel 1
turn K2 1
expect seqrate 1
turn K3 1
expect seqdir 1
turn K4 10
expect seqswing 40
shot seqcfg.png
release SEQ
wait 100
expect cfg 0
expect view 0
# 32 steps: two pages on the second row (OCT+ goes to page 2, then OCT+ again is back to 1)
tap OCT+
expect spage 1
tap OCT+
expect spage 0
